{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>After that</b> — I was looking in the night visions, and behold, a fourth beast, fearsome and dreadful and exceedingly strong, and it has great iron teeth; it eats and crushes, and what remains it tramples with its feet, and it differs from all the first beasts, and it has ten horns."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:16.772165318Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}